---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Terms & Legal | Smart Accounting Solutions';
const description = 'Website terms of use for Smart Accounting Solutions.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
  <section class="section policy">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <h1 class="h2">Website Terms of Use</h1>
      <hr class="gold-divider" />
      <p class="lead">
        These terms explain the rules for using our website. By using our website, you agree
        to these terms, so please take a moment to read them.
      </p>

      <div class="policy-body">
        <h2 class="h3">At a Glance</h2>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>This website is for general information only. It isn't personal financial or tax advice.</li>
          <li>You're welcome to browse our website and share links to our content, but not to copy or reuse it commercially without asking.</li>
          <li>We try to keep the website accurate and available, but we can't guarantee it will always be perfect or fault-free.</li>
          <li>These terms are separate from our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>, which cover how we handle your data.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h3">Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by Smart Accounting Solutions, a trading style of The
          Intelligent Assembly Ltd, a company registered in England and Wales under company
          number 11203679. Our registered office is Office 2, Queens Building, Green Road,
          Penistone, South Yorkshire, S36 6FQ.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these terms, you can contact us at
          <a href="mailto:info@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk">info@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk</a>
          or on <a href="tel:+441143493311">0114 3493311</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Accepting These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By using our website, you agree to these Terms of Use, along with our
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>. If
          you don't agree with any part of these terms, please stop using the website.
        </p>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time, so it's a good idea to check back
          occasionally. Continuing to use the website after changes have been made means you
          accept the updated terms.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Using Our Website</h2>
        <p>
          You're welcome to browse our website and use the information on it for your own
          personal or business purposes. You must not:
        </p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>use the website in any way that breaks the law, or is fraudulent or harmful</li>
          <li>try to gain unauthorised access to our website, servers, or any systems connected to it</li>
          <li>introduce viruses, malware, or any other harmful code</li>
          <li>copy, reproduce, or republish content from our website for commercial purposes without our permission</li>
          <li>use automated tools (such as bots or scrapers) to extract data from our website without our permission</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="h3">No Advice On This Website</h2>
        <p>
          The content on our website is provided for general information only. It does not
          take account of your personal circumstances and should not be treated as financial,
          tax, accounting, or legal advice.
        </p>
        <p>
          You should always speak to us directly, or seek independent professional advice,
          before making any decisions based on information found on our website. We are not
          responsible for any loss arising from decisions made solely on the basis of website
          content.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, we own or hold the licence to use all content on this
          website, including text, graphics, logos and our brand. This content is protected by
          copyright and other intellectual property laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may view, download, and print pages from our website for your own personal use.
          You must not modify, copy, distribute, or use any content for commercial purposes
          without our written permission.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Links To Other Websites</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to other websites for your convenience. We don't
          control these websites and aren't responsible for their content, accuracy, or privacy
          practices. Visiting a linked website is at your own risk, and we'd recommend checking
          the relevant website's terms and privacy policy.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Availability Of Our Website</h2>
        <p>
          We try to keep our website up and running smoothly, but we can't guarantee it will
          always be available or error-free. We may need to suspend, withdraw, or restrict
          access to all or part of our website, for example for maintenance, without notice.
        </p>
        <p>We aren't liable if, for any reason, our website is unavailable at any time or for any period.</p>

        <h2 class="h3">Our Responsibility To You</h2>
        <p>
          We've taken reasonable care to make sure the information on our website is accurate
          at the time of publishing. However, we don't make any promises or guarantees about
          its accuracy, completeness, or suitability for your particular circumstances.
        </p>
        <p>To the extent permitted by law, we won't be responsible for:</p>
        <ul class="policy-list">
          <li>any loss or damage arising from your use of, or inability to use, our website</li>
          <li>any inaccuracies, errors, or omissions in the content on our website</li>
          <li>any loss or damage caused by viruses or other harmful technology that may affect your device as a result of using our website</li>
          <li>any indirect or consequential loss, including loss of profits, business, revenue, or data, even if we've been advised such loss was possible</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This reflects the fact that our website is provided free of charge, for general information purposes only.</p>
        <p>
          Nothing in these terms excludes or limits our liability where it would be unlawful to
          do so, for example for death or personal injury caused by our negligence, or for
          fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Your Data And Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Any personal data you give us through our website is handled in line with our
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, and our use of cookies is explained in our
          <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes relating to
          these terms or our website will be dealt with by the courts of England and Wales.
        </p>

        <h2 class="h3">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Use, please get in touch:</p>
        <ul class="policy-contact">
          <li><span>Email</span> <a href="mailto:info@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk">info@smartaccountingsolutions.co.uk</a></li>
          <li><span>Phone</span> <a href="tel:+441143493311">0114 3493311</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy-body { margin-top: var(--space-6); }

  .h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    color: var(--sas-purple-deep);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-size: 21px;
    margin: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-3);
  }
  .h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  .policy-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
  }
  .policy-body a { color: var(--action-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .policy-body a:hover { color: var(--action-primary-hover); }

  .policy-list {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    padding-left: 1.2em;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .policy-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  .policy-contact {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .policy-contact li { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--text-body); }
  .policy-contact span { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-heading); margin-right: 6px; }
  .policy-contact a { color: var(--action-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .policy-contact a:hover { color: var(--action-primary-hover); }
</style>
